{"unit_id":"Aonysen__dsh-memory-rag#card-zh","repo":"Aonysen/dsh-memory-rag","commit":"9527a91f49863e7f16e109335e44b137e436dc41","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory-rag 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的长期记忆插件。它把用户明确保存的事实和导入的 Markdown、MDX、TXT 文档切块存入本地记忆库，并通过 DSH 工具提供语义检索、记忆写入、批量导入、删除和状态查询。检索支持 OpenAI 兼容嵌入服务，也可使用本地 BM25 关键词模式；会话开始时还能注入置顶、当前项目近期记忆和文件索引。设置页可管理端点、模型、检索参数和记忆条目。云端嵌入会发送被处理的文本；本地关键词模式无需 API Key 或网络。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:33-74","lib/tools.js:469-555","lib/inject.js:52-146","lib/embedder.js:86-99"]}
{"unit_id":"Aonysen__dsh-memory-rag#card-en","repo":"Aonysen/dsh-memory-rag","commit":"9527a91f49863e7f16e109335e44b137e436dc41","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-memory-rag adds searchable memory to DSH Web. It stores notes and imported text locally, with tools to search, save, ingest, and delete. Search uses embeddings or offline BM25; sessions can receive a local index. Cloud mode sends text to its embedding service; BM25 needs no key or network.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:33-74","lib/tools.js:469-555","lib/inject.js:52-146","lib/embedder.js:86-99"]}
